## Why This Is Asked
Assesses advanced AWS ABAC, cross-account governance, and policy-as-code in a multi-tenant data lake; targets practical use of IAM Identity Center, PrincipalTags, Lake Formation, and a GitOps deployment flow.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC with session/principal tags
- Lake Formation fine-grained permissions
- Cross-account policy deployment (GitOps)
- Revocation latency and audits (CloudTrail, Config, Access Analyzer)

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": { "Federated": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:saml-provider/AWS_SSO" },
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole",
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id": "tenant-A"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject", "s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake",
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake/tenant-A/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": { "s3:prefix": "tenant-A/" }
      }
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["lakeformation:GetDataLocation", "lakeformation:GetTable", "lakeformation:GrantPermissions", "glue:GetDatabase", "glue:GetTable"],
      "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": { "aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id": "tenant-A" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test revocation latency end-to-end? 
- How would you scale this across many tenants and regions?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to craft strict per-tenant isolation across multiple AWS accounts, combining STS-based role assumption, granular S3 bucket policies, KMS key rotation, and an auditable governance workflow. It also exercises incident response via quarantine and DynamoDB auditing.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-account IAM roles and trust policies
- S3 bucket policies with prefix-scoped access
- AWS KMS CMK rotation and key policy implications
- Lambda-based policy enforcement and DynamoDB auditing
- Canary testing for tenancy violations and quarantine workflows

